        "like": 2
      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with this canny.\n\nWhy criticize giving bonus to those who pay a large amount? Since the concept of volume discounts is common in business practice, I think this bonus credit offer is legitimate.\n\nFurthermore, it would help correct the current pricing structure in VRChat, where the more credits you buy at once, the higher the price. I have submitted a vote for this at https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/the-more-credits-you-receive-at-once-the-higher-the-price .",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
