  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-11-23T16:51:53.553Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In some games for purchasing in-game currency, there are sometimes options where the platform will provide more than the currency ratio if purchased  in a larger quantity.\n\nCurrently, all quantities are the exact same. The current setup is\n\n$4.99 USD = 600 credits\n\n$9.99 USD = 1,200 credits\n\n$9.99 USD = 1,2000 credits\n\nAn example of a better incentive for players to buy a larger quantity would be:\n\n$4.99 USD = 600 credits\n\n$9.99 USD = 1,200 credits (+100 bonus credits!)\n\n$99.99 USD = 12,000 credits (+1,000 bonus credits!)",
